  "evidence": [
    "Pinned game 4C7250 returns AL zero for absent device, otherwise tail-jumps provider slot DC. Catalog QAEH name is historical reconstructed identity, not authentic debug evidence; preserve it while updating emitted symbol through native writer.",
    "Pinned soundx mode1 factory installs table10065738; slot55 at10065814 selects stub1000245A then10021B90, testing bits20 atCC and2 atC8 and returning canonical zero/one. Bool expresses this predicate; uchar is machine-code compatible and original spelling remains unproved.",
    "Read-only native overlay controls: int baseline MNEMONIC_ONLY; bool wrapper alone MISMATCH due normalization; bool wrapper plus provider declaration BYTE_EXACT, unsigned-char pair also exact. Retain true hierarchy and slot order, no casts or hand-written dispatch.",
    "Require native measurement/recording, actual-source return-contract and provider-slot tests, full build/link and source identity/reference continuity; coordinator-reviewed manual integration only, not full-game acceptance."
  ],
  "intent": "Recover the byte-return Wave predicate contract across wrapper and external provider view without changing slot order or behavior.",
